    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks. That makes sense. The weirdest part is that the logs show the cooling unit was working perfectly fine until it just... stopped for several minutes, then kicked back on at full power, then died again. It's like the sensor reading is just jumping around for no reason. Does that sound like a mechanical failure or a sensor glitch? We need to figure out if we can trust the readings from the rest of the shipment.",
