      "content": "Yeah, I'll get the team to start manual checks immediately. It's just frustrating because the maintenance crew checked this unit last week and it was fine. It feels like something is actively messing with the system, honestly. Is there any scenario where a mechanical component fails in this specific pattern—just random, nonsensical surges and drops—without a clear part being broken? Like, could there be an external interference or something?",
